],"tip":"become 后常接名词或形容词作表语。"},{"word":"wake up","meaning":"醒来；叫醒","pos":"v. phrase","phonetic":"/weɪk ʌp/","emoji":"⏰","morphology":[],"collocations":[{"phrase":"wake up early","example":"I wake up early on school days. / 上学日我醒得很早。"}],"irregularForms":[{"label":"wake 的过去式","form":"woke"},{"label":"wake 的过去分词","form":"woken"}],"synonyms":[],"wordFamily":[],"tip":"wake up 可不带宾语；叫醒某人可说 wake someone up。"},{"word":"put on","meaning":"穿上；戴上；打开（设备）","pos":"v. phrase","phonetic":"/pʊt ɒn/","emoji":"🧥","morphology":[],"collocations":[{"phrase":"put on a coat","example":"Put on your coat before you go out. / 出门前穿上外套。"}],"irregularForms":[{"label":"put 的过去式和过去分词","form":"put"}],"synonyms":[],"wordFamily":[],"tip":"put on 强调穿戴动作；wear 强调穿戴状态。"},{"word":"take off","meaning":"脱下；起飞；迅速成功","pos":"v. phrase","phonetic":"/teɪk ɒf/","emoji":"🛫","morphology":[],"collocations":[{"phrase":"take off your shoes","example":"Please take off your shoes. / 请脱下鞋子。"}],"irregularForms":[{"label":"take 的过去式","form":"took"},{"label":"take 的过去分词","form":"taken"}],"synonyms":[],"wordFamily":[],"tip":"take off 既可表示“脱下”，也可表示飞机“起飞”。"},{"word":"hang up","meaning":"挂断（电话）；挂起","pos":"v. phrase","phonetic":"/hæŋ ʌp/","emoji":"☎️","morphology":[],"collocations":[{"phrase":"hang up the phone","example":"Do not hang up the phone. / 不要挂断电话。"}],"irregularForms":[{"label":"hang 的过去式和过去分词","form":"hung"}],"synonyms":[],"wordFamily":[],"tip":"hang up 是可分短语动词：hang it up。"},{"word":"wear","meaning":"穿着；戴着；留着（发型）","pos":"v.","phonetic":"/weə/","emoji":"👕","morphology":[],"collocations":[{"phrase":"wear a uniform","example":"We wear a uniform at school. / 我们在学校穿校服。"}],"irregularForms":[{"label":"过去式","form":"wore"},{"label":"过去分词","form":"worn"}],"synonyms":[],"wordFamily":[],"tip":"wear 强调穿戴状态；put on 强调动作。"},{"word":"go home","meaning":"回家","pos":"v. phrase","phonetic":"/ɡəʊ həʊm/","emoji":"🏠","morphology":[],"collocations":[{"phrase":"go home after school","example":"I go home after school. / 我放学后回家。"}],"irregularFo